{"id":"wellington","name":"惠灵顿","en":"Wellington","country":"New Zealand","lat":-41.3,"lng":174.7833,"dek":"风大、坡陡、咖啡浓的首都。","history":"公元10世纪前后，波利尼西亚人抵达这片海湾，毛利语中称它为Te Upoko o te Ika a Maui，意为“毛伊鱼的头部”。1839年9月，第一批欧洲移民乘船到来；次年1月，第二批移民抵达。最初的定居点计划建在海边平地上，但因潮湿易涝，居民很快把房屋迁往山坡。1840年，这里以英国名将阿瑟·韦尔斯利、第一代威灵顿公爵的名号命名为惠灵顿。\n\n1848年，一系列强烈地震袭击了年轻的定居点。1855年，又一次地震发生，有记录认为其强度可能达到8.2级，港口附近一块土地被抬升出海面，后来成为中心商业区的一部分。此后很长一段时间，惠灵顿的房屋多为木构。20世纪起，建筑的抗震要求逐步提高。\n\n1865年7月，惠灵顿取代奥克兰成为新西兰首都，当时人口约4900人。选择它的部分原因是位置居中、拥有良港，也有对南岛产金地区可能另立殖民地的担忧。如今，议会、政府和最高法院都设在这里，首都地位由惯例而非立法确定。","culture":"惠灵顿集中了新西兰国家档案馆、国家图书馆、新西兰国立博物馆和多个全国性艺术团体，如新西兰交响乐团与皇家芭蕾舞团。城市里小型独立画廊数量众多，许多艺术家在此工作。咖啡文化和夜生活集中在中心商业区南部，Te Aro一带是娱乐场所最密集的区域。\n\n这里也是新西兰电影工业的重镇，维塔工作室参与制作的《指环王》系列让惠灵顿在国际影迷中有了具体位置。移民构成多元，来自东亚、南亚、欧洲和太平洋岛国的社群共同塑造了饮食和街头面貌。","pull":"风从库克海峡来，城市往山坡上长。","sights":[{"name":"新西兰国立博物馆","orig":"Museum of New Zealand Te Papa Tongarewa","intro":"新西兰国家博物馆，展示自然史、毛利文化与移民历史。建筑靠近海滨，常设展涵盖从地质到当代社会的多个层面，是理解这个国家最直接的地方。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Museum_of_New_Zealand_Te_Papa_Tongarewa.jpg/960px-Museum_of_New_Zealand_Te_Papa_Tongarewa.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":480},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B4%90%E8%A5%BF%E8%98%AD%E5%9C%8B%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"},{"name":"惠灵顿缆车","orig":"Wellington Cable Car","intro":"从市中心兰姆顿码头一路爬升到凯尔本，是俯瞰城市与港口的便捷方式。缆车博物馆就在终点附近，展示这条山地交通线的历史与旧车厢。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/78/Wellington_Cable_Car_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":897},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wellington_Cable_Car"},{"name":"西兰蒂亚","orig":"Zealandia","intro":"城市近郊的生态保护区，用围栏隔绝外来掠食者，保护奇异鸟、鳄蜥、沙螽等本地物种。步道穿过原生森林，能见到新西兰在人类定居前的环境面貌。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Karori_Wildlife_Sanctuary_location.jpg/960px-Karori_Wildlife_Sanctuary_location.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":462},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zealandia_(wildlife_sanctuary)"},{"name":"维多利亚山","orig":"Mount Victoria","intro":"紧邻市区的制高点，可看到机场、海港、中心商业区和周边山丘的全景。山顶风大，视野开阔，是理解惠灵顿地形与城市密度的好位置。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Mt_Victoria_.jpg/960px-Mt_Victoria_.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":510},"src":null},{"name":"旧圣保罗教堂","orig":"Old St Paul's","intro":"一座木结构哥特复兴式前座堂，建于19世纪，内部大量使用本土木材。光线透过彩色玻璃落进深色木梁之间，是惠灵顿木构建筑传统的代表。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Old_St_Paul%27s_church%2C_Wellington%2C_2016-01-25-7.jpg/960px-Old_St_Paul%27s_church%2C_Wellington%2C_2016-01-25-7.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":632},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_St_Paul's%2C_Wellington"}],"foods":[{"name":"白饵鱼煎饼","orig":"Whitebait fritter","intro":"用春季洄游的幼鱼与蛋液混合煎成，口感细嫩。常见于季节菜单，配柠檬直接吃，是新西兰人珍视的本地野味。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Gianchetti_and_poutine.jpg/960px-Gianchetti_and_poutine.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitebait"},{"name":"帕芙洛娃","orig":"Pavlova","intro":"蛋白霜为底，外层酥脆内里软绵，通常铺上打发的奶油和新鲜水果。惠灵顿的咖啡馆与家庭聚会常见，甜度高但口感轻。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Pavlova_dessert.JPG/960px-Pavlova_dessert.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":715},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pavlova"},{"name":"毛利窑烤","orig":"Hāngī","intro":"将肉类与根茎蔬菜放入地坑，以烧热的石头覆盖焖熟，带有泥土与烟熏气息。出现在节庆或毛利文化活动中，惠灵顿地区可见。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Hangi_prepare.jpg/960px-Hangi_prepare.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C4%81ng%C4%AB"},{"name":"平白咖啡","orig":"Flat white","intro":"一份浓缩咖啡加细腻奶泡，比例介于拿铁与卡布奇诺之间。惠灵顿咖啡馆密度高，平白是判断店家水准的基本款。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Flat_white_coffee_with_pretty_feather_pattern.jpg/960px-Flat_white_coffee_with_pretty_feather_pattern.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%A5%E8%8A%AE%E7%99%BD"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/City_Lights_%2833522578970%29.jpg/1280px-City_Lights_%2833522578970%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":500},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Cuba_Street_at_dusk.jpg/1280px-Cuba_Street_at_dusk.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[174.3880382,-41.4271501],[174.4128758,-41.4694321],[174.4294172,-41.4573542],[174.4504237,-41.4778493],[174.4711143,-41.4936652],[174.494016,-41.5076571],[174.5188467,-41.519652],[174.5498435,-41.5309251],[174.5777745,-41.5381186],[174.611079,-41.5506471],[174.734974,-41.5873931],[174.7656443,-41.6057852],[174.7995966,-41.620587],[174.9824984,-41.67828],[174.993867,-41.6990593],[175.0056731,-41.7155553],[175.0194911,-41.7311509],[175.035201,-41.7457088],[175.0526656,-41.7591009],[175.0757233,-41.7734672],[175.0964904,-41.7838953],[175.1184748,-41.792821],[175.1509278,-41.8026458],[175.1848255,-41.8092041],[175.209599,-41.8118235],[175.2689534,-41.8150277],[175.3036371,-41.814893],[175.3333097,-41.8126463],[175.3864896,-41.8044169],[175.4191893,-41.7967554],[175.4503014,-41.7860193],[175.4832561,-41.7702149],[175.5077967,-41.7656104],[175.5316411,-41.7592836],[175.5545743,-41.7512925],[175.5763893,-41.7417092],[175.6358692,-41.7082488],[175.6537533,-41.6959695],[175.6700699,-41.682522],[175.6932543,-41.6761377],[175.715547,-41.6681695]